ardt","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-44","title":"格哈特之眼","titleEn":"Eyes of Gerhardt","rarity":"very-rare","description":["当一名异端修理完成发电机、打开出口大门或离开储物柜时，所有异端的气场对你显示5秒。"],"flavor":"\"目睹此番惊世之景，喜极自剜双目。\"（《蛮族》第2卷第60章）。","icon":"/icons/T_UI_iconAddon_EyesOfGerhardt.webp","glyph":0,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Eyes_of_Gerhardt","pinyin":"gehatezhiyan","initials":"ghtzy"},{"id":"addon:will_of_the_gods:crown_of_the_destroyer","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-44","title":"毁灭者之冠","titleEn":"Crown of the Destroyer","rarity":"very-rare","description":["当一名逃生者救赎另一名流放逃生者时，在20秒内，","·你的恐惧范围缩小70%。","·你的恐惧范围会被复制到每一处审判者神龛。","·你获得无法侦测状态。","无法侦测状态会隐藏杀手的气场、恐惧范围与红光。"],"flavor":"“造物诸神见此，加之以冕并道：‘以辟黑暗。’”（《蛮族》第1卷第6章）","icon":"/icons/T_UI_iconAddon_CrownOfTheDestroyer.webp","glyph":1,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Crown_of_the_Destroyer","pinyin":"huimiezhezhiguan","initials":"hmzzg"},{"id":"addon:will_of_the_gods:holy_winged_icon","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-44","title":"圣翼像","titleEn":"Holy Winged Icon","rarity":"rare","description":["操控圣光时，按杀手能力键可以朝自己方向释放。","以此方式释放圣光时，","·达到致命效果前的最短延迟为0.4秒。","·最大速度增加10%。","·仅对异端造成伤害。"],"flavor":"“拥之入怀，抚胸而祷，惧心不诚。”（《异端论》第2卷第14章）","icon":"/icons/T_UI_iconAddon_HolyWingedIcon.webp","glyph":5,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Holy_Winged_Icon","pinyin":"shengyixiang","initials":"syx"},{"id":"addon:will_of_the_gods:electric_torch","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-44","title":"手电","titleEn":"Electric Torch","rarity":"rare","description":["圣光被操控时的最大速度增加25%。","操控圣光时杀手移速增加10%。"],"flavor":"“一个众信徒深夜群起而出，搜寻匿于暗处的异端。” （《科恩拉德的见证》第40章）","icon":"/icons/T_UI_iconAddon_ElectricTorch.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Electric_Torch","pinyin":"shoudian","initials":"sd"},{"id":"addon:will_of_the_gods:blindfold_of_the_devoted","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-44","title":"虔诚眼罩","titleEn":"Blindfold of the Devoted","rarity":"rare","description":["每当你流放一名上钩次数最少的逃生者时，32米外其他上